#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Add or remove that number as a note"
msgstr "Poner o quitar ese número como nota"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Delete the number of the cell or, if it has none, its notes"
msgstr "Borrar el número de la casilla o, si no tiene, sus notas"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Undo the last change"
msgstr "Deshacer el último cambio"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts, in lessons.
msgid "In the lessons, a number that does not fit is not written"
msgstr "En las lecciones, un número que no va no se escribe"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Writing"
msgstr "Escribir"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Información"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Notes of the cell"
msgstr "Notas de la casilla"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Which numbers the row has and which are missing"
msgstr "Qué números tiene la fila y cuáles faltan"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Which numbers the column has and which are missing"
msgstr "Qué números tiene la columna y cuáles faltan"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Which numbers the block has and which are missing"
msgstr "Qué números tiene el bloque y cuáles faltan"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "How many empty cells are left"
msgstr "Cuántas casillas faltan"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Short hint: where to look and what to look for"
msgstr "Pista breve: dónde mirar y qué buscar"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Full hint: which number goes where, and why"
msgstr "Pista completa: qué número va, dónde y por qué"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "In a sudoku without help there are no hints"
msgstr "En un sudoku sin ayudas no hay pistas"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Hints"
msgstr "Pistas"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Lessons"
msgstr "Lecciones"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Repeat the instruction of the exercise"
msgstr "Repetir la instrucción del ejercicio"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Repeat the explanation of the lesson"
msgstr "Repetir la explicación de la lección"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Board menu: new sudoku, check, restart, keyboard shortcuts and close"
msgstr "Menú del tablero: nuevo sudoku, comprobar, reiniciar, atajos de teclado y cerrar"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Lesson menu: next lesson, practice, list of lessons, keyboard shortcuts and close"
msgstr "Menú de la lección: siguiente lección, practicar, lista de lecciones, atajos de teclado y cerrar"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Menu and window"
msgstr "Menú y ventana"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "This list of keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Esta lista de atajos de teclado"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Close the window; the sudoku and the progress are kept"
msgstr "Cerrar la ventana; el sudoku y el progreso se guardan"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Close the window"
msgstr "Cerrar la ventana"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts: commands that work from anywhere.
msgid "From anywhere"
msgstr "Desde cualquier lugar"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Open the board: continue the unfinished sudoku or start a new one"
msgstr "Abrir el tablero: continuar el sudoku sin terminar o empezar uno nuevo"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Open the sudoku of the day"
msgstr "Abrir el sudoku del día"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Open Learn to play"
msgstr "Abrir Aprender a jugar"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Show My statistics"
msgstr "Mostrar Mis estadísticas"

#. Translators: shown in the list of keyboard shortcuts when a command has no key.
msgid "no key assigned"
msgstr "ninguna tecla asignada"

#. Translators: introduction of the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "You can change these keys in the NVDA menu, Preferences, Input gestures, category MiSudokuAccesible (with the focus on the board for the board keys)."
msgstr "Puedes cambiar estas teclas en el menú de NVDA, Preferencias, Gestos de entrada, categoría MiSudokuAccesible (con el foco en el tablero para las teclas del tablero)."

#. Translators: title of the window with the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Atajos de teclado"

#. Translators: state of a completed lesson in the list of lessons.
msgid "Completed, {stars} of {total} stars."
msgstr "Completada, {stars} de {total} estrellas."

#. Translators: state of a lesson started but not finished, in the list of lessons.
msgid "In progress: {done} of {total} exercises."
msgstr "En curso: {done} de {total} ejercicios."

#. Translators: state of a lesson not started, in the list of lessons.
msgid "Pending."
msgstr "Pendiente."

#. Translators: best practice round of a lesson, shown in the list of lessons.
msgid "Best practice: {stars} of {total}."
msgstr "Mejor práctica: {stars} de {total}."

#. Translators: block heading before the first lesson of a block, as in "Block A, Getting to know sudoku."
msgid "Block {block}, {title}."
msgstr "Bloque {block}, {title}."

#. Translators: label of the list of lessons.
msgid "&Lessons:"
msgstr "&Lecciones:"

#. Translators: button that starts the selected lesson.
#. Translators: button that starts the exercises of a lesson.
msgid "&Start"
msgstr "&Empezar"

#. Translators: button that starts a practice round of the selected lesson.
msgid "&Practice"
msgstr "&Practicar"

#. Translators: button that closes the list of lessons.
msgid "&Close"
msgstr "&Cerrar"

#. Translators: said at the end of a lesson explanation.
msgid "This lesson has {count} exercise."
msgid_plural "This lesson has {count} exercises."
msgstr[0] "Esta lección tiene {count} ejercicio."
msgstr[1] "Esta lección tiene {count} ejercicios."

#. Translators: said when a lesson is resumed, as in "You will continue from exercise 3."
msgid "You will continue from exercise {number}."
msgstr "Seguirás desde el ejercicio {number}."

#. Translators: button that goes back to the list of lessons.
msgid "&Back"
msgstr "&Volver"

#. Translators: said when a lesson is finished, as in "You finished lesson 1! You have 11 of 12 stars."
msgid "You finished lesson {id}! You have {stars} of {total} stars."
msgstr "¡Terminaste la lección {id}! Tienes {stars} de {total} estrellas."

#. Translators: said at the end of a lesson.
msgid "Open the menu with the Applications key to go on to the next lesson."
msgstr "Abre el menú con la tecla Aplicaciones para pasar a la siguiente lección."

#. Translators: said while the first exercise of a practice round is prepared.
msgid "Preparing the practice..."
msgstr "Preparando la práctica..."

#. Translators: reported when a practice exercise could not be prepared.
msgid "The practice could not be prepared. Please try again."
msgstr "No se pudo preparar la práctica. Inténtalo de nuevo."

#. Translators: said while the next practice exercise is still being prepared.
msgid "Preparing the next exercise..."
msgstr "Preparando el siguiente ejercicio..."

#. Translators: said at the end of a practice round, as in "You finished the practice round with 13 of 15 stars. Your best: 14. Open the menu to play another round."
msgid "You finished the practice round with {stars} of {total} stars. Your best: {best}. Open the menu to play another round."
msgstr "Terminaste la ronda de práctica con {stars} de {total} estrellas. Tu mejor ronda: {best}. Abre el menú para jugar otra."

#. Translators: label of the board size choice in the new sudoku dialog.
msgid "&Size:"
msgstr "&Tamaño:"

#. Translators: label of the difficulty level choice in the new sudoku dialog.
msgid "&Level:"
msgstr "&Nivel:"

#. Translators: label of the choice of hints and clash warnings in the new sudoku dialog.
msgid "&Help:"
msgstr "A&yudas:"

#. Translators: an option of the Help choice in the new sudoku dialog.
msgid "On: hints and clash warnings"
msgstr "Activadas: pistas y aviso de choques"

#. Translators: an option of the Help choice in the new sudoku dialog.
msgid "Off: no hints or clash warnings"
msgstr "Desactivadas: sin pistas ni aviso de choques"

#. Translators: title of the statistics window.
msgid "My statistics"
msgstr "Mis estadísticas"

#. Translators: label of the choice of how cell positions are said, in the settings panel.
msgid "Say the &position of the cells:"
msgstr "Decir la &posición de las casillas:"

