msgstr "Larga (Fila 3, columna 5)"

#. Translators: option of how cell positions are said, in the settings panel.
msgid "Short (R3C5)"
msgstr "Corta (F3C5)"

#. Translators: check box in the settings panel.
msgid "When writing a number, remove that &note from its row, column and block"
msgstr "Al escribir un número, quitar esa &nota de su fila, su columna y su bloque"

#. Translators: check box in the settings panel.
msgid "Announce when a row, column or block is &complete"
msgstr "Anunciar cuando una fila, columna o bloque está &completo"

