msgid "Play s&ounds (complete groups, exercises, solved sudokus)"
msgstr "Reproducir s&onidos (grupos completos, ejercicios, sudokus resueltos)"

#. Translators: button in the settings panel.
msgid "&Delete my progress and statistics..."
msgstr "&Borrar mi progreso y estadísticas..."

#. Translators: asked before deleting the progress and statistics.
msgid "This deletes your progress in the course, your practice rounds, the days in a row and the statistics of your sudokus. Unfinished sudokus are kept. It cannot be undone. Delete them?"
msgstr "Se borrará tu progreso en el curso, tus rondas de práctica, los días seguidos y las estadísticas de tus sudokus. Los sudokus a medias se conservan. No se puede deshacer. ¿Borrarlos?"

#. Translators: title of the confirmation to delete the progress.
msgid "Delete my progress and statistics"
msgstr "Borrar mi progreso y estadísticas"

#. Translators: reported after deleting the progress and statistics.
msgid "Your progress and statistics were deleted."
msgstr "Se borraron tu progreso y tus estadísticas."

#. Translators: description of a lesson command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Repeats the instruction of the exercise"
msgstr "Repite la instrucción del ejercicio"

#. Translators: description of a lesson command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Repeats the explanation of the lesson"
msgstr "Repite la explicación de la lección"

#. Translators: said when pressing Control+Z in a lesson.
msgid "In the lessons there is nothing to undo: a number that does not fit is not written."
msgstr "En las lecciones no hay nada que deshacer: un número que no va no se escribe."

#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the cell above"
