#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the cell below"
msgstr "Va a la casilla de abajo"

#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the cell on the left"
msgstr "Va a la casilla de la izquierda"

#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the cell on the right"
msgstr "Va a la casilla de la derecha"

#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the first cell of the row"
msgstr "Va a la primera casilla de la fila"

#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the last cell of the row"
msgstr "Va a la última casilla de la fila"

#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the next empty cell"
