#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Deletes the number of the cell or, if it has none, its notes"
msgstr "Borra el número de la casilla o, si no tiene, sus notas"

#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Undoes the last change"
msgstr "Deshace el último cambio"

#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Gives a short hint: where to look and what to look for"
msgstr "Da una pista breve: dónde mirar y qué buscar"

#. Translators: description of a sudoku board command in the Input gestures dialog.
