msgstr "&Siguiente lección"

#. Translators: item of the menu of a lesson.
msgid "&Practice this lesson"
msgstr "&Practicar esta lección"

#. Translators: item of the menu of a lesson.
msgid "&List of lessons..."
msgstr "&Lista de lecciones..."

#. Translators: item of the menu of the board and of the lessons.
msgid "&Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Atajos de &teclado"

#. Translators: item of the menu of a lesson.
msgid "&Close the lesson"
msgstr "&Cerrar la lección"

#. Translators: title of the window of the sudoku of the day, as in "MiSudokuAccesible - Sudoku of the day, Medium".
msgid "MiSudokuAccesible - Sudoku of the day, {level}"
msgstr "MiSudokuAccesible - Sudoku del día, {level}"

#. Translators: title of the sudoku board window, as in "MiSudokuAccesible - 9 by 9, Easy".
msgid "MiSudokuAccesible - {size}, {level}"
msgstr "MiSudokuAccesible - {size}, {level}"

#. Translators: added to the title of the board window of a sudoku without help.
msgid "without help"
msgstr "sin ayudas"

#. Translators: item of the menu of the sudoku board.
msgid "C&heck"
msgstr "C&omprobar"

#. Translators: item of the menu of the sudoku board.
msgid "&Restart"
msgstr "&Reiniciar"

#. Translators: item of the menu of the sudoku board.
msgid "&Close the board"
msgstr "&Cerrar el tablero"

#. Translators: asked before restarting the sudoku.
msgid "All the numbers and notes you wrote will be deleted, and the time goes back to zero. Restart?"
msgstr "Se borrarán todos los números y notas que escribiste, y el tiempo volverá a cero. ¿Reiniciar?"

#. Translators: title of the confirmation to restart the sudoku.
msgid "Restart"
msgstr "Reiniciar"

#. Translators: said after restarting the sudoku, followed by how many empty cells are left.
msgid "Sudoku restarted."
msgstr "Sudoku reiniciado."

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid "Accessible sudoku for NVDA, for all ages.\nPlay 9 by 9 sudokus in three levels and mini sudokus of 4 by 4 and 6 by 6, with every cell readable by speech and braille. Includes hints that explain every move; Learn to play, a guided 13-lesson course also designed for children, with endless practice of each technique; a sudoku of the day; and your statistics.\nThe Learn to play course is currently available in Spanish only."
msgstr "Sudoku accesible para NVDA, para todas las edades.\nJuega sudokus de 9 por 9 en tres niveles y mini sudokus de 4 por 4 y 6 por 6, con cada casilla legible por voz y en braille. Incluye pistas que explican cada jugada; Aprender a jugar, un curso guiado de 13 lecciones pensado también para niñas y niños, con práctica sin fin de cada técnica; un sudoku del día; y tus estadísticas.\nPor ahora, el curso Aprender a jugar solo está disponible en español."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid "First stable version. Play 9 by 9 sudokus in three levels and mini sudokus of 4 by 4 and 6 by 6, with or without help; learn with hints that explain every move and with the 13-lesson course, with endless practice; play the sudoku of the day; and check your statistics."
msgstr "Primera versión estable. Juega sudokus de 9 por 9 en tres niveles y mini sudokus de 4 por 4 y 6 por 6, con o sin ayudas; aprende con pistas que explican cada jugada y con el curso de 13 lecciones, con práctica sin fin; juega el sudoku del día; y consulta tus estadísticas."
